MultiLingualTexts:
  - id: MLC_4wY
    en-US: |2-
       ============================================================
        TRANSPORTER
        Flat FSM â€” Moore machine

        Top state : TR.STATUS.state   (NORMAL=1 / FAULT=0)
        Flat step : TR.STATUS.step    (IDLE=10 / FILLING=20 / SEALING=30 /
                                       PRESSURIZING=40 / CONVEYING=50 / DEPRESSURIZING=60)

        Devices
          XV01  Inlet (loading) valve        UDT_SS_Sealed_Valve
          XV02  Vent valve                   UDT_DS_Valve
          XV03  Orifice valve                UDT_SS_Valve
          XV04  Outlet (discharge) valve     UDT_SS_Valve
          XV05  Line valve                   UDT_SS_Valve
          XY    Pressurization solenoid      UDT_Solenoid_valve
          WT01  Load cells                   UDT_Load_cells
          LSH   Vessel high-level switch     Bool
          PSL   Supply air pressure switch   Bool
          PT01  Vessel pressure              UDT_Analogic_signal
          PT02  Line pressure                UDT_Analogic_signal
       ============================================================
       ============================================================
        UDT_Transporter
       ============================================================
