  - id: MLC_4yw
    en-US: SETTING - Line pressure threshold to consider empty (barg)
  - id: MLC_38S
    en-US: SETTING - Vessel overpressure required before opening line valve (barg)
  - id: MLC_49g
    en-US: SETTING - Internal valves timeout setting
  - id: MLC_57E
    en-US: SETTING - Timeout timer for pressurization phase
  - id: MLC_4hF
    en-US: SETTING - Timeout timer for depressurization phase
