    en-US: STATUS - Loading valves closing
  - id: MLC_cq
    en-US: STATUS - Vessel being pressurized
  - id: MLC_Rr
    en-US: STATUS - Material being conveyed
  - id: MLC_3Mv
    en-US: STATUS - Vessel venting to atmosphere
  - id: MLC_5BV
    en-US: STATUS - Transporter is in fault
  - id: MLC_54k
    en-US: OUT - Loading setpoint reached
  - id: MLC_3f2
    en-US: OUT - Full cycle completed, back to idle
  - id: MLC_kF
    en-US: OUT - kg transferred in last cycle
  - id: MLC_wE
    en-US: ALARM - Pressurization phase took too long
  - id: MLC_hq
    en-US: ALARM - Depressurization phase took too long
